@1 = ~Knife Master~

@2 = ~KNIFE MASTER: Knife masters are trained killers who specialize in close–up combat and the wave and weave of knife fighting. In their hands, daggers become truly deadly instruments.

Advantages:
– May achieve grandmastery with daggers and mastery in dual–wielding.

Disadvantages:
– May only distribute 10 skill points per level (30 at level 1) among thieving skills.~